<http://data.silknow.org/object/c8d91cc5-62b0-35ed-be25-03ebe0f850e1/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Brocade woven in floss silk and silver and silver-gilt thread. The pattern consists of undulating and twisted bands of foliations in silver, interlaced with scalloped leaves in gold, outlined and veined in red, and crossed by bunches of flowers in white and shades of red and green. The foliations form compartments, which enclose larger bunches of flowers. The pattern is on a gold ground."@en ;
